Package: pulzr-drivers
Depends: pulzr-base, ucode, ucode-mod-fs, curl, ca-bundle, mosquitto-client-ssl, nftables-json
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: all
Description: Run device packages' drivers for the devices on this gateway.
 A device type's package may carry a driver, a ucode script that speaks that
 device's own protocol (an IP camera's settings API). Pulzar delivers the
 drivers of the adapter devices this gateway is given, with each device's
 address and login; this checks each against its SHA-256 and runs one process
 per command, as that device's own user, able to reach only its address,
 within CPU, memory and time limits. Nothing device-specific is in the OS.
